{"s":36,"v":[{"t":"Yā, Seen.","w":[["يسٓ","Ya Seen","ya-seen",""]]},{"t":"By the wise Qur’ān,","w":[["وَٱلْقُرْءَانِ","By the Quran","wal-qur'āni","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["قُرْءَانِ",186]]],["ٱلْحَكِيمِ","the Wise","l-ḥakīmi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَكِيمِ",133]]]]},{"t":"Indeed you, [O Muḥammad], are from among the messengers,","w":[["إِنَّكَ","Indeed, you","innaka","",[["إِنَّ",15],["كَ",18]]],["لَمِنَ","(are) among","lamina","",[["لَ",23],["مِنَ",6]]],["ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","the Messengers","l-mur'salīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُرْسَلِينَ",345]]]]},{"t":"On a straight path.","w":[["عَلَىٰ","On","ʿalā",""],["صِرَٰطٍۢ","a Path","ṣirāṭin",""],["مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","Straight","mus'taqīmin",""]]},{"t":"[This is] a revelation of the Exalted in Might, the Merciful,","w":[["تَنزِيلَ","A revelation","tanzīla",""],["ٱلْعَزِيزِ","(of) the All-Mighty","l-ʿazīzi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَزِيزِ",130]]],["ٱلرَّحِيمِ","the Most Merciful","l-raḥīmi","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحِيمِ",119]]]]},{"t":"That you may warn a people whose forefathers were not warned, so they are unaware.","w":[["لِتُنذِرَ","That you may warn","litundhira","",[["لِ",8],["تُنذِرَ",272]]],["قَوْمًۭا","a people","qawman",""],["مَّآ","not","mā",""],["أُنذِرَ","were warned","undhira",""],["ءَابَآؤُهُمْ","their forefathers","ābāuhum","",[["ءَابَآؤُ",122],["هُمْ",3]]],["فَهُمْ","so they","fahum","",[["فَ",7],["هُمْ",3]]],["غَـٰفِلُونَ","(are) heedless","ghāfilūna",""]]},{"t":"Already the word [i.e., decree] has come into effect upon most of them, so they do not believe.","w":[["لَقَدْ","Certainly","laqad","",[["لَ",23],["قَدْ",37]]],["حَقَّ","(has) proved true","ḥaqqa",""],["ٱلْقَوْلُ","the word","l-qawlu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَوْلُ",137]]],["عَلَىٰٓ","upon","ʿalā",""],["أَكْثَرِهِمْ","most of them","aktharihim","",[["أَكْثَرِ",156],["هِمْ",3]]],["فَهُمْ","so they","fahum","",[["فَ",7],["هُمْ",3]]],["لَا","(do) not","lā",""],["يُؤْمِنُونَ","believe","yu'minūna","",[["يُؤْمِنُ",30],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, We have put shackles on their necks, and they are to their chins, so they are with heads [kept] aloft.","w":[["إِنَّا","Indeed, We","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["ا",11]]],["جَعَلْنَا","[We] have placed","jaʿalnā","",[["جَعَلْ",45],["نَا",11]]],["فِىٓ","on","fī",""],["أَعْنَـٰقِهِمْ","their necks","aʿnāqihim","",[["أَعْنَـٰقِ",908],["هِمْ",3]]],["أَغْلَـٰلًۭا","iron collars","aghlālan",""],["فَهِىَ","and they","fahiya","",[["فَ",7],["هِىَ",22]]],["إِلَى","(are up) to","ilā",""],["ٱلْأَذْقَانِ","the chins","l-adhqāni","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَذْقَانِ",1704]]],["فَهُم","so they","fahum","",[["فَ",7],["هُم",3]]],["مُّقْمَحُونَ","(are with) heads raised up","muq'maḥūna",""]]},{"t":"And We have put before them a barrier and behind them a barrier and covered them, so they do not see.","w":[["وَجَعَلْنَا","And We have made","wajaʿalnā","",[["وَ",1],["جَعَلْ",45],["نَا",11]]],["مِنۢ","from","min",""],["بَيْنِ","before/between","bayni",""],["أَيْدِيهِمْ","their hands/their front","aydīhim","",[["أَيْدِي",116],["هِمْ",3]]],["سَدًّۭا","a barrier","saddan",""],["وَمِنْ","and from","wamin","",[["وَ",1],["مِنْ",6]]],["خَلْفِهِمْ","behind them","khalfihim","",[["خَلْفِ",470],["هِمْ",3]]],["سَدًّۭا","a barrier","saddan",""],["فَأَغْشَيْنَـٰهُمْ","and We covered them","fa-aghshaynāhum","",[["فَ",7],["أَغْشَيْ",1471],["نَ",11],["ـٰهُمْ",3]]],["فَهُمْ","so they","fahum","",[["فَ",7],["هُمْ",3]]],["لَا","(do) not","lā",""],["يُبْصِرُونَ","see","yub'ṣirūna","",[["يُبْصِرُ",385],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And it is all the same for them whether you warn them or do not warn them - they will not believe.","w":[["وَسَوَآءٌ","And it (is) same","wasawāon","",[["وَ",1],["سَوَآءٌ",405]]],["عَلَيْهِمْ","to them","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["ءَأَنذَرْتَهُمْ","whether you warn them","a-andhartahum","",[["ءَ",31],["أَنذَرْ",272],["تَ",18],["هُمْ",3]]],["أَمْ","or","am",""],["لَمْ","(do) not","lam",""],["تُنذِرْهُمْ","warn them","tundhir'hum","",[["تُنذِرْ",272],["هُمْ",3]]],["لَا","not","lā",""],["يُؤْمِنُونَ","they will believe","yu'minūna","",[["يُؤْمِنُ",30],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"You can only warn one who follows the message and fears the Most Merciful unseen. So give him good tidings of forgiveness and noble reward.","w":[["إِنَّمَا","Only","innamā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["مَا",0]]],["تُنذِرُ","you (can) warn","tundhiru",""],["مَنِ","(him) who","mani",""],["ٱتَّبَعَ","follows","ittabaʿa",""],["ٱلذِّكْرَ","the Reminder","l-dhik'ra","",[["ٱل",2],["ذِّكْرَ",132]]],["وَخَشِىَ","and fears","wakhashiya","",[["وَ",1],["خَشِىَ",306]]],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنَ","the Most Gracious","l-raḥmāna","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحْمَـٰنَ",216]]],["بِٱلْغَيْبِ","in the unseen","bil-ghaybi","ۖ",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["غَيْبِ",251]]],["فَبَشِّرْهُ","So give him glad tidings","fabashir'hu","",[["فَ",7],["بَشِّرْ",318],["هُ",5]]],["بِمَغْفِرَةٍۢ","of forgiveness","bimaghfiratin","",[["بِ",10],["مَغْفِرَةٍۢ",401]]],["وَأَجْرٍۢ","and a reward","wa-ajrin","",[["وَ",1],["أَجْرٍۢ",128]]],["كَرِيمٍ","noble","karīmin",""]]},{"t":"Indeed, it is We who bring the dead to life and record what they have put forth and what they left behind, and all things We have enumerated in a clear register.","w":[["إِنَّا","Indeed, We","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["ا",11]]],["نَحْنُ","[We]","naḥnu",""],["نُحْىِ","[We] give life","nuḥ'yī",""],["ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","(to) the dead","l-mawtā","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَوْتَىٰ",322]]],["وَنَكْتُبُ","and We record","wanaktubu","",[["وَ",1],["نَكْتُبُ",252]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["قَدَّمُوا۟","they have sent before","qaddamū","",[["قَدَّمُ",409],["وا۟",3]]],["وَءَاثَـٰرَهُمْ","and their footprints","waāthārahum","ۚ",[["وَءَ",1],["اثَـٰرَ",639],["هُمْ",3]]],["وَكُلَّ","and every","wakulla","",[["وَ",1],["كُلَّ",43]]],["شَىْءٍ","thing","shayin",""],["أَحْصَيْنَـٰهُ","We have enumerated it","aḥṣaynāhu","",[["أَحْصَيْ",806],["نَ",11],["ـٰهُ",5]]],["فِىٓ","in","fī",""],["إِمَامٍۢ","a Register","imāmin",""],["مُّبِينٍۢ","clear","mubīnin",""]]},{"t":"And present to them an example: the people of the city, when the messengers came to it -","w":[["وَٱضْرِبْ","And set forth","wa-iḍ'rib","",[["وَ",1],["ٱضْرِبْ",226]]],["لَهُم","to them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُم",3]]],["مَّثَلًا","an example","mathalan",""],["أَصْحَـٰبَ","(of the) companions","aṣḥāba",""],["ٱلْقَرْيَةِ","(of) the city","l-qaryati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَرْيَةِ",218]]],["إِذْ","when","idh",""],["جَآءَهَا","came to it","jāahā","",[["جَآءَ",57],["هَا",22]]],["ٱلْمُرْسَلُونَ","the Messengers","l-mur'salūna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُرْسَلُونَ",345]]]]},{"t":"When We sent to them two but they denied them, so We strengthened [them] with a third, and they said, \"Indeed, we are messengers to you.\"","w":[["إِذْ","When","idh",""],["أَرْسَلْنَآ","We sent","arsalnā","",[["أَرْسَلْ",106],["نَآ",11]]],["إِلَيْهِمُ","to them","ilayhimu","",[["إِلَيْ",26],["هِمُ",3]]],["ٱثْنَيْنِ","two (Messengers)","ith'nayni",""],["فَكَذَّبُوهُمَا","but they denied both of them","fakadhabūhumā","",[["فَ",7],["كَذَّبُ",80],["و",3],["هُمَا",66]]],["فَعَزَّزْنَا","so We strengthened them","faʿazzaznā","",[["فَ",7],["عَزَّزْ",3861],["نَا",11]]],["بِثَالِثٍۢ","with a third","bithālithin","",[["بِ",10],["ثَالِثٍۢ",2285]]],["فَقَالُوٓا۟","and they said","faqālū","",[["فَ",7],["قَالُ",16],["وٓا۟",3]]],["إِنَّآ","Indeed, We","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["آ",11]]],["إِلَيْكُم","to you","ilaykum","",[["إِلَيْ",26],["كُم",4]]],["مُّرْسَلُونَ","(are) Messengers","mur'salūna",""]]},{"t":"They said, \"You are not but human beings like us, and the Most Merciful has not revealed a thing. You are only telling lies.\"","w":[["قَالُوا۟","They said","qālū","",[["قَالُ",16],["وا۟",3]]],["مَآ","Not","mā",""],["أَنتُمْ","you","antum",""],["إِلَّا","(are) but","illā",""],["بَشَرٌۭ","human beings","basharun",""],["مِّثْلُنَا","like us","mith'lunā","",[["مِّثْلُ",168],["نَا",11]]],["وَمَآ","and not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَنزَلَ","has revealed","anzala",""],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","the Most Gracious","l-raḥmānu","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحْمَـٰنُ",216]]],["مِن","any","min",""],["شَىْءٍ","thing","shayin",""],["إِنْ","Not","in",""],["أَنتُمْ","you","antum",""],["إِلَّا","(are) but","illā",""],["تَكْذِبُونَ","lying","takdhibūna","",[["تَكْذِبُ",786],["ونَ",4]]]]},{"t":"They said, \"Our Lord knows that we are messengers to you,","w":[["قَالُوا۟","They said","qālū","",[["قَالُ",16],["وا۟",3]]],["رَبُّنَا","Our Lord","rabbunā","",[["رَبُّ",24],["نَا",11]]],["يَعْلَمُ","knows","yaʿlamu",""],["إِنَّآ","that we","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["آ",11]]],["إِلَيْكُمْ","to you","ilaykum","",[["إِلَيْ",26],["كُمْ",4]]],["لَمُرْسَلُونَ","(are) surely Messengers","lamur'salūna","",[["لَ",23],["مُرْسَلُونَ",345]]]]},{"t":"And we are not responsible except for clear notification.\"","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["عَلَيْنَآ","(is) on us","ʿalaynā","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["نَآ",11]]],["إِلَّا","except","illā",""],["ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","the conveyance","l-balāghu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["بَلَـٰغُ",614]]],["ٱلْمُبِينُ","clear","l-mubīnu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُبِينُ",117]]]]},{"t":"They said, \"Indeed, we consider you a bad omen. If you do not desist, we will surely stone you, and there will surely touch you, from us, a painful punishment.\"","w":[["قَالُوٓا۟","They said","qālū","",[["قَالُ",16],["وٓا۟",3]]],["إِنَّا","Indeed, we","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["ا",11]]],["تَطَيَّرْنَا","[we] see an evil omen","taṭayyarnā","",[["تَطَيَّرْ",1747],["نَا",11]]],["بِكُمْ","from you","bikum","ۖ",[["بِ",10],["كُمْ",4]]],["لَئِن","If","la-in","",[["لَ",23],["ئِن",27]]],["لَّمْ","not","lam",""],["تَنتَهُوا۟","you desist","tantahū","",[["تَنتَهُ",590],["وا۟",4]]],["لَنَرْجُمَنَّكُمْ","surely, we will stone you","lanarjumannakum","",[["لَ",23],["نَرْجُمَ",1335],["نَّ",0],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَلَيَمَسَّنَّكُم","and surely will touch you","walayamassannakum","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",23],["يَمَسَّ",222],["نَّ",0],["كُم",4]]],["مِّنَّا","from us","minnā","",[["مِّنَّ",6],["ا",11]]],["عَذَابٌ","a punishment","ʿadhābun",""],["أَلِيمٌۭ","painful","alīmun",""]]},{"t":"They said, \"Your omen [i.e., fate] is with yourselves. Is it because you were reminded? Rather, you are a transgressing people.\"","w":[["قَالُوا۟","They said","qālū","",[["قَالُ",16],["وا۟",3]]],["طَـٰٓئِرُكُم","Your evil omen","ṭāirukum","",[["طَـٰٓئِرُ",1356],["كُم",4]]],["مَّعَكُمْ","(be) with you","maʿakum","ۚ",[["مَّعَ",84],["كُمْ",4]]],["أَئِن","Is it because","a-in","",[["أَ",31],["ئِن",27]]],["ذُكِّرْتُم","you are admonished","dhukkir'tum","ۚ",[["ذُكِّرْ",546],["تُم",4]]],["بَلْ","Nay","bal",""],["أَنتُمْ","you","antum",""],["قَوْمٌۭ","(are) a people","qawmun",""],["مُّسْرِفُونَ","transgressing","mus'rifūna",""]]},{"t":"And there came from the farthest end of the city a man, running. He said, \"O my people, follow the messengers.","w":[["وَجَآءَ","And came","wajāa","",[["وَ",1],["جَآءَ",57]]],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["أَقْصَا","(the) farthest end","aqṣā",""],["ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","(of) the city","l-madīnati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَدِينَةِ",664]]],["رَجُلٌۭ","a man","rajulun",""],["يَسْعَىٰ","running","yasʿā",""],["قَالَ","He said","qāla",""],["يَـٰقَوْمِ","O my People","yāqawmi","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰقَوْمِ",38],["",20]]],["ٱتَّبِعُوا۟","Follow","ittabiʿū","",[["ٱتَّبِعُ",101],["وا۟",4]]],["ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","the Messengers","l-mur'salīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُرْسَلِينَ",345]]]]},{"t":"Follow those who do not ask of you [any] payment, and they are [rightly] guided.","w":[["ٱتَّبِعُوا۟","Follow","ittabiʿū","",[["ٱتَّبِعُ",101],["وا۟",4]]],["مَن","(those) who","man",""],["لَّا","(do) not","lā",""],["يَسْـَٔلُكُمْ","ask (of) you","yasalukum","",[["يَسْـَٔلُ",125],["كُمْ",4]]],["أَجْرًۭا","any payment","ajran",""],["وَهُم","and they","wahum","",[["وَ",1],["هُم",3]]],["مُّهْتَدُونَ","(are) rightly guided","muh'tadūna",""]]},{"t":"And why should I not worship He who created me and to whom you will be returned?","w":[["وَمَا","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["لِىَ","(is) for me","liya","",[["لِ",8],["ىَ",20]]],["لَآ","(that) not","lā",""],["أَعْبُدُ","I worship","aʿbudu",""],["ٱلَّذِى","the One Who","alladhī",""],["فَطَرَنِى","cr